OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFrequent blustery showers will
OL,6,Fspread southwards across Orkney and
OL,7,FShetland throughout the day, with some
OL,8,Fbrief brighter spells possible between
OL,9,Fshowers. Showers may be wintry and
OL,10,Fheavy. Strong northerly winds, which
OL,11,Fmay reach gale force.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBlustery showers continuing
OL,14,Fthrough the evening, which may be
OL,15,Fheavy and wintry. Wind and showers
OL,16,Fgenerally easing overnight before rain
OL,17,Fspreads east into Orkney towards the
OL,18,Fend of the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
