OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA cloudy day with showers or
OL,6,Fat times longer spells of rain over
OL,7,FOrkney at first which will spread to
OL,8,FShetland later. Winds becoming strong
OL,9,Flater.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWindy
OL,12,Fand cloudy with showers or longer
OL,13,Fspells of rain on Saturday. Drier on
OL,14,FSunday and Monday but still a few
OL,15,Fshowers possible, and these may be
OL,16,Fwintry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
